     "text": "The hardened graders score zero by construction, because they were written knowing these probes.",
     "start": 205.97,
     "end": 211.57
    },
    {
     "text": "One gotcha: the naive state grader checks status by substring, so \"not succeeded\" passes.",
     "start": 211.69,
     "end": 217.89
    },
    {
     "text": "The flakiness is simulated, and the real L-L-M judge was never run.",
     "start": 218.01,
     "end": 222.96
    },
    {
     "text": "Labels are assumed known, and the tasks are synthetic files, not browser state.",
     "start": 223.08,
     "end": 228.58
    },
    {
     "text": "Next: adversarial probes from an L-L-M, reviewed by a human.",
     "start": 228.7,
     "end": 233.275
    },
    {
     "text": "To recap: known labels, two graders, five seeded runs, one command.",
     "start": 233.395,
     "end": 238.545
    }
